{
  "mn33:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 33 ",
  "mn33:0.2": "Mahāgopālakasutta ",
  "mn33:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn33:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn33:1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "mn33:1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "mn33:1.5": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn33:1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn33:2.1": "“Ekādasahi, bhikkhave, aṅgehi samannāgato gopālako abhabbo gogaṇaṁ pariharituṁ phātiṁ kātuṁ. ",
  "mn33:2.2": "Katamehi ekādasahi? ",
  "mn33:2.3": "Idha, bhikkhave, gopālako na rūpaññū hoti, na lakkhaṇakusalo hoti, na āsāṭikaṁ hāretā hoti, na vaṇaṁ paṭicchādetā hoti, na dhūmaṁ kattā hoti, na titthaṁ jānāti, na pītaṁ jānāti, na vīthiṁ jānāti, na gocarakusalo hoti anavasesadohī ca hoti. Ye te usabhā gopitaro gopariṇāyakā te na atirekapūjāya pūjetā hoti. ",
  "mn33:2.4": "Imehi kho, bhikkhave, ekādasahi aṅgehi samannāgato gopālako abhabbo gogaṇaṁ pariharituṁ phātiṁ kātuṁ. ",
  "mn33:3.1": "Evameva kho, bhikkhave, ekādasahi dhammehi samannāgato bhikkhu abhabbo imasmiṁ dhammavinaye vuddhiṁ virūḷhiṁ vepullaṁ āpajjituṁ. ",
  "mn33:3.2": "Katamehi ekādasahi? ",
  "mn33:3.3": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu na rūpaññū hoti, na lakkhaṇakusalo hoti, na āsāṭikaṁ hāretā hoti, na vaṇaṁ paṭicchādetā hoti, na dhūmaṁ kattā hoti, na titthaṁ jānāti, na pītaṁ jānā